obtain your consent before using your personal data for any other purposes. If you wish to request for access to and/or correction of your personal data, you may do so under the Personal Data (Privacy) Ordinance. Such request should be made in writing and addressed to the Director of Human Resources, Human Resources Office, Tung Wah College, 90A Shantung Street, Mongkok, Kowloon Careers +   Academic Post +   Non-academic Post +   Research Post +   Project Post +   Internal Advertisement +   Equal Opportunity Employer +   Application Guidelines +   Personal Information Collection Statement (PICS) +   Information for Prospective Employees Working at TWC TWC Life QUICK LINKS +   CLD Scheme Record System +   Medical and Dental Schemes +   Staff Handbook +   Regulations and Guidelines +   HR Forms +   Training Materials +   Others QUICK LINKS +   CLD Scheme Record System +   Medical and Dental Schemes +   Staff Handbook +   Regulations and Guidelines +   HR Forms +   Training Materials +   Others Tung Wah Group of Hospitals Integrative Health Centre Adverse Weather Arrangements Campus Map Careers Contact Us King’s Park Campus Ma Kam Chan Memorial Building, 31 Wylie Road, Homantin, Hong Kong Mongkok Campus Cheung Kung Hai Memorial Building, 90A, and Cheung Chin Lan Hong Building, 98, Shantung Street, Mongkok, Hong Kong Kwai Hing Campus 8/F, Tower 1 and 16/F, Tower 2, Kowloon Commerce Centre, 51 Kwai Cheong Road, Kwai Chung, Hong Kong Tsim Sha Tsui Campus 136A, Nathan Road, Kowloon, Hong Kong General Enquiries: Tel: (852) 3190 6678 Email: enquiry@twc.edu.hk Admission Enquiries: Undergraduate & Sub-degree Programmes Tel: (852) 3190 6672 Email: applytwc@twc.edu.hk Postgraduate Programmes Tel: (852) 3859 8928 Email: gro@twc.edu.hk Disclaimer Privacy Policy Accessibility Statement Site Map ©2026 Tung Wah College Limited. All Rights Reserved."
